  4. Update the publish date and set `draft: false` when ready to publish.
  5. Commit the article and uploaded images; push to main to rebuild /learn.

  VISUAL EDITOR
  -------------
  From the repo root:  npm run write
  Then open http://127.0.0.1:4322/keystatic, a full editing UI that
