  just a UI over them.

  `draft: true`, not the filename, keeps this template out of the published
  site, RSS, sitemap, and llms.txt. New editor entries also start as drafts.
  A research-note editorial status labels a piece but does not hide it.
  Leave this template here as a reference; it will never publish while draft.
